OUTPUT CONTRACT
Return exactly one JSON object and nothing else on standard output. Do not
wrap it in Markdown.

{{.Schema}}

Rules:
- Escape every backslash inside a JSON string as "\\", and every newline of
  the comment as "\n".
- "schema_version" must be "{{.SchemaVersion}}".
- "language" names the language you wrote in, in English: "French",
  "English".
- "body" is the whole comment, in Markdown.
